cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use PyAPS in your research, please cite it using the metadata below.
  The DOI above is the version-specific DOI of the final publication snapshot of 2.0
  (tag v2.0-rasti, Zenodo version 'v2.0-rasti'); the concept DOI under `identifiers`
  always resolves to the newest version.
title: PyAPS
type: software
abstract: >-
  Python-based Advanced Processing System for WEAVE: a platform for
  processing and analysing WEAVE survey spectroscopic data (MOS, mIFU, and
  LIFU observing modes), developed as part of the WEAVE Science Processing
  and Analysis (SPA) system.
authors:
  - name: "WEAVE APS Team"
  - given-names: Alireza
    family-names: Molaeinezhad
    email: amolaei@ast.cam.ac.uk
    affiliation: >-
      CAMCEAD, Institute of Astronomy, University of Cambridge
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/camcead/PyAPS"
url: "https://camcead.ast.cam.ac.uk"
repository-artifact: "https://github.com/camcead/PyAPS/releases"
version: "2.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23250780"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.23042510"
    description: "Concept DOI: all versions of PyAPS; it resolves to the newest version"
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.23042511"
    description: "Superseded: archive of the earlier v2.0 tag (commit 1684edf, 2026-09-29)"
date-released: "2026-10-09"
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - spectroscopy
  - WEAVE
  - survey
  - data analysis
